ruggling  with it a little bit honestly louis has  definitely been there for me over the  past couple of uh weeks which i've got  to say thank you and when louis released  his solo album in january 2020 nile  encouraged his own fans to help make it  a success tweeting quote let's get tomo  right up the charts this album is  quality and deserves to be up there  [Music]  you
 

